{"id":"e55a4d03b99a537e","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-KF-non-conservative.md","title":"完整 KF 对基础 PA 算术非保守","display":"cor-KF-non-conservative — 完整 KF 对基础 PA 算术非保守","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-KF-non-conservative","aliases":["91-cor-KF-non-conservative"],"display":"cor-KF-non-conservative — 完整 KF 对基础 PA 算术非保守","depends_on":["[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency]]","[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","[[91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-KF-non-conservative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-KF-non-conservative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-KF-non-conservative — 完整 KF 对基础 PA 算术非保守"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a295446296ee06c0\" href=\"?note=a295446296ee06c0\" title=\"91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency\">91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"719296019c11ec36\" href=\"?note=719296019c11ec36\" title=\"91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness\">91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 为原书完整版本及基础算术；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> 使用自然证明编码。</li>\n<li>PA 在标准 ℕ 中可靠，因而一致，并适用通常第二不完备定理；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> 为基础语言保守性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}KF\\text{-}non\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}),\\qquad\n\\neg\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}KF\\text{-}non\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}),\\qquad\n\\neg\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一个是上游实际 KF 定理，第二个是标准 PA 的第二不完备性，取同一个算术见证即可否定保守性。旧稿又把第一个定理放入待满足条件，并把对象 Con(PA) 无解释地混入元层条件，现明确论证层级。\n结论不涉及任意弱 KF 变体，也不是 KF 可证自身一致性。</p>\n<p>来源：§15.3 的强度下界；上游 KF 一致性后果及通常第二不完备性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"a295446296ee06c0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"719296019c11ec36","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}KF\\text{-}non\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}),\\qquad\n\\neg\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{PA}).","display":true}],"bytes":1491,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-199","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-KF-non-conservative]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-199","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-KF-non-conservative]]"}],"outgoing":["a295446296ee06c0","4a1d989a5f615933","719296019c11ec36"]}